 "title": "Power-torsion submodule",
 "statement": "Let $R$ be a ring, let $M$ be an $R$-module, and let $a\\in R$. Define\n\n$$\n\\Gamma_{(a)}(M)\n=\\{m\\in M\\mid \\text{there is }n\\geq0\\text{ with }a^nm=0\\}.\n$$",
